OL,3,GNEWSAMayor agrees to air condition all
OL,4,ALondon buses
OL,5,
OL,6,FLondon Mayor Sadiq Khan has told unions
OL,7,Fhe will install air conditioning across
OL,8,Fall of Transport for London's bus
OL,9,Fnetwork by 2027.
OL,11,FDrivers and members of Unite have been
OL,12,Fon strike about working in hot weather,
OL,13,Fcomplaining their cabs often exceed
OL,14,F40C.
OL,16,FStaff reported falling ill with
OL,17,Fheatstroke and narrowly avoiding
OL,18,Fcrashes this summer.
OL,20,FCabs will also be fitted with UV
OL,21,Fprotective film to reduce the risk of
OL,22,Fskin cancer.
